{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2021-10-01 14:02:00', 'title': 'PNC DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $1.25 ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK OF $1.25 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE NOV. 5, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS OCT. 15, 2021.'}